commits.body:
Closes the two app-facing halves of notification-fabric Task 13 that
were deferred in June. The iOS/watch side (Tasks 1–12) shipped then;
these are the producers it has been waiting on.

Replay PR3 of the June agent-surface: flag-gated assistant.search.context
using Slack's action_token. Missing token or flag-off skips without error;
hits are bounded markdown, not raw JSON.

Install a 15s LaunchAgent watchdog that kickstarts STT when /health hangs
or the model stalls; delegate to AutoHub parakeet:install when possible;
skip SIGTERM when /health is already ready.

Three endings were dead ends for a first-time user:
- a failed endpoint verify printed only the raw HTTP diagnostic and exited;
- declining the apply confirm evaporated all wizard answers with a bare
  "No files were changed.";
- Ctrl-C said "canceled" without saying the machine was untouched.

- Classify-bench defaults to Gemma under MLX (not Hermes) when matrix unset
- Prefer LOCAL_UTILITY_MLX_SERVER_DIR over voice venv path
- Require groups[] array for classify/package parseOk; reject schema-invalid {}
